+        "content": "<p>With your account you can...</p>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>Participate in debates</li>\n                    \n                    \n                    <li>Vote for budget projects</li>\n                  </ul>\n\n                  <p>Account verified</p>\n\n                  <p><a href='/'>Go to index page</a></p>"
